.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBCLOSE = \(aq\[u1F7AA]\(aq\fR
The close mark at the end of the title row.
.TP 4
\fBNAME = "\[uFF24]\[uFF2F]\[uFF23]\[uFF36]"\fR
The title at the start of the title row: the name, then the version.
.TP 4
\fBPADDING = 1\fR
Blank columns between the content and either edge of the content
area.
.TP 4
\fBTOP = 2\fR
Screen row of the first content row.
.PP
\fBVERSION = " v#{Docv::VERSION}"\fR
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(rows : Int32, cols : Int32, dock : Int32 = 0)\fR
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.thumb(track : Int32, visible : Int32, total : Int32, offset : Int32, max_offset : Int32) : Tuple(Int32, Int32)\fR
Start and size of a thumb on a \fItrack\fR of cells for a view of
\fIvisible\fR of \fItotal\fR positions, scrolled to \fIoffset\fR of at most
\fImax_offset\fR.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef bottom : Int32\fR
Screen row of the horizontal scrollbar.
.TP 4
\fBdef close_col : Int32\fR
Screen column of the close mark, left of the scrollbar column.
.PP
\fBdef cols : Int32\fR
.PP
\fBdef content_cols : Int32\fR
.PP
\fBdef content_rows : Int32\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef dock : Int32\fR
Columns a regular dock takes left of the content area.
.TP 4
\fBdef draw(screen : Screen, vertical : Tuple(Int32, Int32), horizontal : Tuple(Int32, Int32), line : UInt16, thumb : UInt16, close : UInt16) : Nil\fR
Draws the close mark, the line under the title row and the
scrollbars (thumb start and size on their tracks), in the given
style ids.
.TP 4
\fBdef heading_bounds : Tuple(Int32, Int32)\fR
The first column and the limit (exclusive) of the page\(aqs heading on
the title row: between the name and the close mark.
.TP 4
\fBdef heading_col(width : Int32) : Int32\fR
The first column of a heading \fIwidth\fR columns wide: centered on the
screen, kept within \fB\%heading_bounds\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef inner : Int32\fR
Screen column of the first cell of the content area (padding
included).
.TP 4
\fBdef inner_cols : Int32\fR
Columns of the content area: everything left of the vertical
scrollbar.
.TP 4
\fBdef left : Int32\fR
Screen column of the first content column.
.TP 4
\fBdef name_width : Int32\fR
Columns the name and the version take at the start of the title row.
.TP 4
\fBdef region(row : Int32, col : Int32) : Region\fR
The region of screen cell (\fIrow\fR, \fIcol\fR); the padding is content,
the columns of a regular dock are border.
.TP 4
\fBdef right : Int32\fR
Screen column of the vertical scrollbar.
.PP
\fBdef rows : Int32\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef rule(screen : Screen, row : Int32, line : UInt16) : Nil\fR
Draws a rule across the content area on screen row \fIrow\fR in style
\fIline\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef status_row : Int32\fR
Screen row of the status line.
.TP 4
\fBdef title(screen : Screen, name : UInt16, version : UInt16) : Nil\fR
Writes the title in styles \fIname\fR and \fIversion\fR.
